Item statements extracted from real Form 8-K filings on SEC EDGAR
(https://www.sec.gov/edgar), found via EDGAR full-text search. Labels come from the
8-K item the issuer itself filed under: 1.05 Material Cybersecurity Incidents -> CYBER,
1.03 Bankruptcy or Receivership and 2.04 Triggering Events (debt acceleration) -> CREDIT;
routine items as negatives: 2.02 Results of Operations -> EARNINGS, 5.02 officer changes,
7.01 Regulation FD, 8.01 Other Events and 2.03 new debt obligations -> OTHER.
